        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Katyal, the district court entered an order consolidating the cases brought by brother and sister for all purposes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "12d949bb6519a99951610d9b845f0e29d8335d8eb9e5ac9056f2a481a2f748ae",
