            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The court may direct entry of a final judgment as to one or more, but fewer than all, claims or parties under Rule\u202f54(b)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Katyal",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "12d949bb6519a99951610d9b845f0e29d8335d8eb9e5ac9056f2a481a2f748ae",
